// S-900 (spec §6.3: "`<` `<=` `>` `>=` は `PartialOrd` に絞る。既にある境界が候補の trait に含まれるときは置き換える"): E0401 for `a < b` where
// `T: PartialEq`. `PartialOrd` is above `PartialEq`, so it contains it, and the one candidate replaces the bound: `T: PartialOrd` (not
// `T: PartialEq + PartialOrd`). No diagnostic is left after it.

pub fn below[T: PartialOrd](a: T, b: T) -> Bool {
  a < b                                             //~ E0401
}
